      "desc:8": "The Alien Blaster is the LuV energy weapon: a bolt that explodes on contact, sets its target on fire, and never breaks a block. It holds twenty-five shots on a full charge.\n\nBuild it in the LuV Assembler from two LuV emitters, a LuV sensor, a Carbon Receiver, a Carbon Gunstock, a Lapotronic Orb II, two LuV circuits, and HSS-G plates and screws, with soldering alloy and lubricant. NEI has the exact recipe. It comes out uncharged.\n\n[note]It is a tier 6 electric item. Charge it in a LuV charger or battery buffer. A lower buffer will not take it.[/note]",
